Grid row-major:
1 neutral alert standing battle stance right, both feet firmly grounded, arms relaxed, fixed master design.
2 walk left-foot forward;
3 walk passing;
4 walk right-foot forward;
5 walk recovery;
6 running start leaning forward;
7 running stride left;
8 running airborne stride right;
9 running brake;
10 weighty skid stop leaning back;
11 turn right torso;
12 crouch hands on knees;
13 air neutral knees bent;
14 jump crouch preparation;
15 jumping rise arms balanced;
16 double jump body twist.
Keep full body, head, boots and all cargo visible inside each cell with wide transparent gutters. No giant light streaks or detached props.

